## Outbound APIs

Services this application calls. Each one is a catalog API entity that the component consumes, so it appears in the
topology view. The interface itself is not part of the project, so the entity holds only what the project says about it.

| API | Kind | Endpoint | Called from | Operations |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for oa in outApis -%}
| `${{ oaIds[loop.index0] }}` | ${{ oa.kind }} | ${{ oa.loc if oa.loc != "" else "-" }} | ${{ oa.acts | join(", ") }} | ${{ ((oa.ops | join(", ")) if oa.ops.length > 0 else (oa.hints | join("; ") if oa.hints.length > 0 else "-")) | replace("|", "/") }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
